[1m[38;5;231mHow should a developer override the auto-detected environment?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mlocalStorage (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mlocalStorage.appEnv forces an environment, persists across reloads. Sticky, not visible in the URL.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m URL query param
     [38;5;246m?env=staging. Self-documenting and shareable, but not sticky and visible to any user.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Both, param wins
     [38;5;246mQuery param overrides localStorage, which overrides hostname. Most flexible, one extra precedence rule.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m Hostname only, no override
     [38;5;246mSimplest, but you can't point a local page at staging without editing settings.js.[39m
  [38;5;246m5. Type something.[39m
